From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yash Dayani <52958495+YashDayani@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Settings: add a network speed indicator toggle to Network & internet

Adds a switch to Network & internet that turns the status bar network
speed indicator on or off (Settings.System.NETWORK_TRAFFIC_ENABLED).
When it is on, the current download and upload speed is shown in the
status bar.

The indicator is added by the "SystemUI: add a network speed indicator
to the status bar" patch in platform_frameworks_base, which also adds
the setting; this patch needs it. The other options (mode, units,
refresh interval, auto-hide) stay available as settings and are not
part of this screen.
---
